      <header class="image-size-heading"><div><h2 id="image-size-heading">调整图片显示尺寸</h2><p>在页面预览中查看，确认后随草稿保存。</p></div><button type="button" class="image-size-close" aria-label="关闭尺寸调整"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg></button></header>
